{"update_url": "https://clients2.google.com/service/update2/crx", "manifest_version": 3, "name": "TabPop", "version": "1.0", "description": "\u73fe\u5728\u306e\u30bf\u30d6\u3092\u65b0\u3057\u3044\u30a6\u30a3\u30f3\u30c9\u30a6\u306b\u79fb\u52d5\u3059\u308b\u62e1\u5f35\u6a5f\u80fd\u3067\u3059\u3002\nQuickly pop out tabs into new windows.", "permissions": ["activeTab"], "background": {"service_worker": "background.js"}, "action": {"default_title": "Pop tab to new window"}, "commands": {"pop_tab": {"suggested_key": {"default": "Alt+N", "mac": "Alt+N"}, "description": "Pop the current tab into a new window"}}}